{"product_id":"lost-ground","title":"Lost Ground","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe murder of a beautiful woman shatters the rural village peace of Alfredville, and her husband, the police station commander, is jailed as chief suspect. Her cousin Peter, a freelance writer in London, returns to South Africa for the first time in decades - unsettled, curious, but also in search of a career-defining story.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 157 x 233\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michiel Heyns\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781868424160\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45588415840409,"sku":"15RE-1-9781868424160","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/687de5f5dfe77_Lost_Ground_Michiel_Heyns.jpg?v=1753117895","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/lost-ground","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}